      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَغْبَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A desire,</i> or <i>wish:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَغَبَاتٌ</span>. (Mgh, Msb.)
Hence, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَلَّتْ رَغَبَاتُ النَّاسِ</span> [<i>The desires,</i> or <i>wishes,
of the people,</i> or <i>of mankind, became few</i>].
(Mgh.) ― 
